    },
    {
      "displayText": "來得早不如來得巧！\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳也是個幹練的訓練家吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F865F9765E94E0D59824F865F975DE7FF01000A00100003110000FF01014F6059B34E5F662F500B5E797DF476848A137DF45BB65427300200100002011401380000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我們也是相當幹練的！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n現在運用的戰術合適無比，讓我們\n不論是什麼樣的寶可夢對戰都連戰連勝！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕķ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 460,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621150114E5F662F76F875765E797DF47684FF0100100001BE01000A73FE5728904B75287684623088535408906971216BD4FF0C8B9362115011000A4E0D8AD6662F4EC09EBC6A2376845BF653EF59225C0D623090FD90236230902352DDFF0100100002011401370000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我們為何能如此強大，\n秘密就在於變化招式！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 568,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211501170BA4F5580FD59826B645F375927FF0C000A79D85BC65C31572865BC8B8A531662DB5F0FFF0100100002011401380000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "用變化招式\n讓自己的寶可夢變強！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕķ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 620,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "75288B8A531662DB5F0F000A8B9381EA5DF176845BF653EF59228B8A5F37FF0100100002011401370000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "用變化招式\n讓對手的寶可夢變弱！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 664,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "75288B8A531662DB5F0F000A8B935C0D624B76845BF653EF59228B8A5F31FF0100100002011401380000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "對戰的關鍵不只是在給予傷害。\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳來嚐嚐我們的厲害吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕķ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 708,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C0D6230768495DC93754E0D53EA662F57287D664E8850B75BB33002000A00100003110000FF01014F6059B34F865690569062115011768453B25BB35427300200100002011401370000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳也一定能品嚐到的！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 784,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100003110000FF01014F6059B34E5F4E005B9A80FD54C1569052307684FF0100100002011401380000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "膽敢挑戰我們兩人的變化招式，\n這魯莽……不，這份勇氣值得讚賞！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕķ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 828,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "81BD6562631162306211501151694EBA76848B8A531662DB5F0FFF0C000A90199B6F83BD202620264E0DFF0C90194EFD52C76C23503C5F978B9A8CDEFF0100100002011401370000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如果打算要對戰，\n等<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳準備好就來說一聲吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕķ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 900,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5982679C62537B9789815C0D6230FF0C000A7B4900100003110000FF01014F6059B36E965099597D5C314F868AAA4E0080725427300200100002011401370000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\n",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 964,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳要開始這場名為\n寶可夢對戰的賽事了嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕķ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 976,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100003110000FF01014F6059B38981958B59CB90195834540D70BA000A5BF653EF59225C0D623076848CFD4E8B4E8655CEFF1F00100002011401370000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "開始吧！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1040,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "958B59CB5427FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我準備一下",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1052,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62116E9650994E004E0B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "用變化招式的訓練家\n可說是慢熱型。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n等待對我們來說是家常便飯。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕķ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1064,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "75288B8A531662DB5F0F76848A137DF45BB6000A53EF8AAA662F616271B1578B300200100001BE00000A7B495F855C0D621150114F868AAA662F5BB65E384FBF98EF300200100002011401370000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我的寶可夢使用的變化招式\n能幫自己提升能力！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕķ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1144,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621176845BF653EF59224F7F752876848B8A531662DB5F0F000A80FD5E6B81EA5DF163D0534780FD529BFF0100100002011401370000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "對戰拖得越長，\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳的寶可夢就會越被逼入絕境喔。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕķ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1200,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C0D623062D65F978D8A9577FF0C000A00100003110000FF01014F6059B376845BF653EF59225C3167038D8A88AB903C51657D5558835594300200100002011401370000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1268,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我們現在可是狀況好得不得了！\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳來幫我們更新連勝紀錄吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1280,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211501173FE572853EF662F72C06CC1597D5F974E0D5F974E86FF01000A00100003110000FF01014F6059B34F865E6B6211501166F465B0902352DD7D0093045427FF0100100002011401380000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1360,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "可惡！\n這下子連勝紀錄要喊停了……！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕķ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
